    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P>Keep in mind this is <STRONG>NOT DEFINITIVE, but just the favourite plot, even if it was done before Madonna's recent accident</STRONG>.<STRONG> </STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG>"<EM>Time goes by so slowly</EM>", the music begins as Madonna exits the foyer</STRONG> of an English townhouse sorrounded by her bodyguards. She is set to be disguised in a wig and brown trench coat, just think of <STRONG>Brigitte Bardot</STRONG> in <STRONG>Jean-Luc Godard</STRONG> movie <STRONG>"Contempt"</STRONG>.</P>
<P><STRONG>Madonna slips away, unnoticed</STRONG> leaving only <STRONG>a body double in her place</STRONG>. Madonna starts running through the streets of London, stripping the coat and wig in<STRONG> favor of her real look</STRONG>.</P>
<P>As we already told, the video <STRONG>will find Madonna in multiple, iconic London locations</STRONG> dropping her veil as she dances among everyday people: <STRONG>the double decker, the tube station, the financial district</STRONG> and so on.<BR><BR>Since the crew want to get real reactions from real Londoners – they’ll hide the cameras, until it's time to shed the disguise.</P>
</font></div>
