  <tr>
    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P>Five years ago this week Madonna's single <STRONG>MUSIC</STRONG> reached #1 on the Billboard Hot 100. This was Madonna's 12th #1 single. </P>
<P align=center><IMG height=653 src="/public/hot100bb5yrsago.jpg" width=495 border=0></P>
